From: HiDeck maintainers
Subject: Propagate bundled Brotli headers to libadb

libadb itself compiles compression code. Linking Brotli only to the final
adb executable does not propagate its private include path to that library.

--- a/vendor/CMakeLists.adb.txt
+++ b/vendor/CMakeLists.adb.txt
@@ -204 +204,3 @@
-target_link_libraries(adb
+target_link_libraries(libadb PRIVATE
+	PkgConfig::libbrotlicommon PkgConfig::libbrotlidec PkgConfig::libbrotlienc)
+target_link_libraries(adb
